      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-20T17:50:15Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue/2776-toolbar-tooltips\n\nConflicted files and their resolution:\n- crates/ui/src/egui_app/viewport_bar_tests.rs: both sides added tests at\n  the end of the file. Kept the two sides: the PR's hover_text helper and\n  its two tooltip tests, then main's\n  expanded_bar_contains_controls_without_touching_buttons and\n  typed_move_and_turn_respect_units_and_refuse_bad_input.\n\nSemantic conflict (no text conflict):\n- Main added the Nav::Display button (#2818). The PR's exhaustive tooltip()\n  match had no arm for it. Added the Display arm in viewport_bar.rs, the\n  Display row in the tooltip pin, and changed \"12 buttons\" to \"13 buttons\"\n  in docs/decisions/2776-toolbar-tooltips.md.\n\nRefs #2776\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
